{
  "info": {
    "name": "ms-residentes | CS2032 Condominios",
    "description": "Microservicio de edificios, unidades, residentes y usuarios.\n\nCOMO USARLA\n1. Corre 'Auth / Login (admin)' una vez: el token se guarda solo en {{token}}.\n2. Ya podes ejecutar cualquier endpoint protegido.\n\nPara apuntar a la VM de AWS, cambia la variable base_url y listo.\n\nUsuarios de prueba (password: condominio123):\n  admin@condominio.com        -> ADMIN\n  lucia.vargas@example.com    -> RESIDENTE",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://localhost:9001",
      "description": "Cambiar por http://<ip-vm-produccion>:9001 al desplegar"
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": "",
      "description": "Lo llena solo el request de login"
    },
    {
      "key": "password_demo",
      "value": "condominio123"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "0. Health",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Health check",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/health",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "health"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Verifica que la API responda Y que PostgreSQL este accesible."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Responde 200\", function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "1. Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login (admin)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/login",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "description": "EMPEZAR POR ACA. Guarda el token automaticamente en {{token}}.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"admin@condominio.com\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password_demo}}\"\n}"
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "// Guarda el token en la variable de la coleccion.",
                  "// Asi el resto de los requests quedan autenticados sin copiar y pegar nada.",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    const data = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('token', data.access_token);",
                  "    console.log('Token guardado, vence en ' + data.expires_in + 's');",
                  "}",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Login exitoso', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test('Devuelve un access_token', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.json()).to.have.property('access_token');",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test('NO expone el password_hash', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(JSON.stringify(pm.response.json())).to.not.include('password_hash');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
